## Adversarial level (ADR 0051, M1-03) — post-cutoff required

Déclarer explicitement le niveau adversarial au triage. *Niveau non
déclaré = `A1` (fail-closed).*

```yaml
adversarial_level:
  level: "A0|A1|A2"            # declared per criticality matrix
  level_reason: "<human-readable reason; required for A0>"
  contest_register:            # optional, only when contested
    - objector: "<named gate expert>"
      trigger: "<trigger disputed>"
      rationale: "<rationale for objection>"
      status: "OPEN|RESOLVED"
```

Règles fail-closed (cf. `PILOTAGE.md` §Adversarial level) :
- Niveau déclaré < trigger matchant → escalade obligatoire vers trigger.
- Niveau contesté → `A1` jusqu'à résolution.
- Conflit déclarant/classifier → `A1` (plus prudent).

